      "_note": "In-bounds synthetic frame (valid CRC-8 0xE6) exercising every per-conductor record with a distinct value per phase, derived from the signature table in reference/upstream-codec.js: ActivePowerL1/L2/L3 (0x0C/0x0D/0x0E) 800/750/700 W; CurrentL1/L2/L3 (0x10/0x11/0x12) 3500/3250/3000 mA -> 3.5/3.25/3 A; CurrentN (0x13) 250 mA -> 0.25 A; VoltageL1-N/L2-N/L3-N (0x14/0x15/0x16) 2301/2295/2312 -> 230.1/229.5/231.2 V; PowerfactorL1/L2/L3 (0x17/0x18/0x19) 98/95/92 Cos -> 0.98/0.95/0.92. The meter's own whole-device aggregates stay top-level: ActivePowerL123 (0x0B) 2250 W = 800+750+700, CurrentL123 (0x0F) 9750 mA -> 9.75 A = 3.5+3.25+3, Frequency (0x1A) 500 -> 50.0 Hz."
